              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Yawe anjeba ati, “Pa mwakafye umo, ninshi ubukankala bwa mitundu ya bantu ba mu Keda bwapwilililafye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na pebumba lya bantu abacenjela ukuposa imifwi, ababa ifita fine fine ifya mu Keda, awe pakashalafye abampendwa. Yawe Lesa wakwa Israeli nasosa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.21.17"
            ]
